# INVWINED.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: loans and holds
# of every row at level 3, the 260 items of INVWIN_WINSEEDED.  CTRL-L
# with all chosen shows one Lend form, the help panel saying it is for
# each of the 260, and lends them all, the note counting them.  Items >
# Loans and holds lists the 260 loans: CTRL-/ chooses them, on every
# page, and Return or release (ALT-C R) from the second page asks one
# date and returns them all, the open loans then none.  CTRL-R reserves
# all 260 the same way, and with the reservations all chosen, the focus
# on the second page, Return or release asks as a reservation's release,
# the kind of the focus row, and releases them all.  Every date is
# typed, so that no snapshot holds the day of the run.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINED.SNP is its snapshot; TEST/selchk.py checks
# it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER CTRL-SLASH CTRL-L
S LEND
K TAB
T Carol King
K TAB TAB
T 2020-01-01
K TAB
T 2020-02-01
K ENTER
S LENT
K ALT-I O
S LOANS
K CTRL-SLASH PGDN
S LOANSALL
K ALT-C R
S ASKRET
T 2026-10-03
K ENTER
S RETURNED
K ALT-I I CTRL-SLASH CTRL-R
S RESERVE
K TAB
T Club show
K TAB TAB TAB
T 2026-10-01
K ENTER
S RESERVED
K ALT-I O CTRL-SLASH PGDN ALT-C R
S ASKREL
T 2026-10-02
K ENTER
S RELEASED
K ALT-F X
